{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Something has awakened inside the Virelia Research Station.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once abandoned, the station now hums with unfamiliar life. Systems flicker back online. Corridors breathe. Organic structures creep across metal walls, as if the station itself is slowly changing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are sent to investigate\u2014alone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Little Astronaut is an atmospheric sci-fi puzzle adventure focused on exploration, silence, and environmental storytelling. There is no combat and no dialogue. The world communicates through light, sound, and subtle visual clues, drawing you deeper into a place that no longer feels entirely mechanical.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you explore the station, you will activate forgotten systems, solve environmental puzzles, and uncover fragments of a story told entirely through space, architecture, and movement. The deeper you go, the harder it becomes to tell where technology ends\u2014and something else begins.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by games like Cocoon, Inside, and The Swapper, Little Astronaut offers a quiet, mysterious journey through a living sci-fi environment where every solved puzzle reveals more questions than answers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd11 KEY FEATURES</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Environmental Puzzle Design</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interact with machines, restore power, and unlock new areas through observation and logic.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1964120/extras/4479776a84868ccb5a01a9b6f8a8367e.poster.avif?t=1771070270\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1964120/extras/4479776a84868ccb5a01a9b6f8a8367e.webm?t=1771070270\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1964120/extras/4479776a84868ccb5a01a9b6f8a8367e.mp4?t=1771070270\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Atmospheric Sci-Fi Exploration</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A silent, immersive world driven by lighting, sound design, and organic visual evolution.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Visual Storytelling</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No text logs or dialogue\u2014storytelling emerges naturally from the environment itself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1964120/extras/7881aca9b64d9b0934eb74f356e8bfc0.poster.avif?t=1771070270\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1964120/extras/7881aca9b64d9b0934eb74f356e8bfc0.webm?t=1771070270\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1964120/extras/7881aca9b64d9b0934eb74f356e8bfc0.mp4?t=1771070270\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ambient Soundscape</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Minimalistic music and subtle environmental sounds enhance isolation and discovery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1964120?t=1771070270","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1964120/a5446a2d760a12d3f880853fcaa422d7910d3987/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1771070270","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1964120/c85bac6b0af6ea513dbf1c2353bafb38d22f274c/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1771070270","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1964120/c85bac6b0af6ea513dbf1c2353bafb38d22f274c/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1771070270","categories":[{"descri